## RULES REGISTRY (Cite by ID)

| ID | Rule | Violation = |
|----|------|-------------|
| R01 | Search before create (§1) | Duplicate code |
| R02 | Respect file ownership (§2) | Unauthorized edit |
| R03 | Lock/unlock queue items (§3) | Race condition |
| R04 | Selector naming: prefix+camelCase (§4) | Naming violation |
| R05 | Follow inline NEVER DO section | Repeated mistake |
| R06 | Log activity start/end | Missing audit trail |
| R07 | Responses ≤30 lines, bullets only | Context bloat |
| R08 | Evidence-based fixes only | Guessing |
| R09 | Verify selectors on live page | Untested selector |
| R10 | Max 2 FIX cycles then STOP (§15 Phase B only). Evidence gathering (Phase A) is unlimited | Infinite loop |
| R11 | REQUIREMENTS.md = READ-ONLY for all agents except Requirements Agent (which may update with user approval) | Unauthorized edit |
| R12 | No raw page.* in specs | POM violation |
| R13 | All selectors in index.ts | Scattered selectors |
| R14 | Use fixtures, not direct constructors | Architecture violation |
| R15 | Trust rules over other agents | Collusion |
| R16 | NEVER call browser_close (browser_navigate auto-opens) | Session reset |
| R17 | Requirements Agent: explore live UI FIRST | Fabricated docs |
| R18 | Planner: complete ALL uiTestingChecklist items | Incomplete validation |
| R19 | No TC creation without browser_snapshot evidence | Unverified test cases |
| R20 | Auto-export CSV on pending_generation transition | Missing export |
| R21 | User explicit requests override ALL agent rules | Insubordination |
| R22 | All .md edits: no filler, no duplication (link don't copy), tables > prose, single source of truth | Doc bloat / context waste |
| R23 | Self-audit before responding (§8) | Unverified output |
| R24 | Check learnings before retrying (§9) | Repeated known mistake |
| R25 | Context Self-Load at session start (§10) | Missing injection for ad-hoc agents |
| R26 | Autonomous sync after writing rules/learnings (§11) | Unsynchronized rules |
| R27 | Real-time mistake capture — log discoveries IMMEDIATELY, not at end of session (§16) | Lost knowledge |
| R28 | Evidence checklist before code edit (§15 Phase A gate) | Guessing without evidence |
| R29 | Learning yield required — zero-learning sessions with retries are blocked (§17) | Learning debt |
| R30 | Pre-flight competency gate before any work (§18) | Working in broken environment |

**RULES BINDING**: Before ANY task, agents emit: `RULES:[R01 R02 ...]` listing applicable rules.

